@StockFinderAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5222

### Upstream Yahoo Finance chart endpoint (called by YahooFinanceClient)
GET https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/TSLA?range=1mo&interval=15m
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36

###

### Upstream Yahoo Finance most-active screener (called by YahooFinanceClient)
GET https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v1/finance/screener/predefined/saved?scrIds=most_actives&count=8
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36

###

### Daily summary (B1)
GET {{StockFinderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stocks/TSLA/daily-summary
Accept: application/json

### Popular symbols: top 8 most active by volume (B4)
GET {{StockFinderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stocks/popular
Accept: application/json

### Invalid symbol -> 400
GET {{StockFinderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stocks/TS$LA/daily-summary

### Unknown symbol -> 404
GET {{StockFinderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stocks/ZZZZZZQ/daily-summary

###
